     "latex": "W_{\\text{nc}} = -fd = -\\mu_{\\text{k}} mgd",
     "ktex": "\\kWnc = -\\kff\\kd = -\\mu_{\\text{k}} m\\kg\\kd",
     "condition": "物体与表面之间存在简单的摩擦",
     "anchor": "16.7-friction-example"
